{"version":1,"content":"<p>經常關注差評的差友們應該知道，我們每年總要參加幾場國際活動，比方説什麼蘋果發佈會啦、 CES 啦、MWC 之類的，總之就是全球可飛。跑得多了，辦公室裏慢慢就出現了一堆充電頭轉換器。什麼方腳圓腳啥樣的都有，同事每次從不同的地方回來都能扔一個在這，跟旅行青蛙似的。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585754.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.114755+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:43:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"d74cd9296d4f47cfbe12764af1b3f51be973723edef38f794ebdcf5044fd6292","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}